&lt;li&gt;Create an effective feedback loop between the frontline, product, strategy, and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and regularly communicate detailed reporting for other leaders across the company who will use your team&#39;s data to inform their own operations and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you&#39;d have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience in supply chain, finance planning, in an operational role and/or in a top tier consulting firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An undergraduate degree from a top university in an analytics heavy major (e.g., Engineering or Economics) and/or a graduate degree from a top university in Engineering, Economics, or Business&lt;/li&gt;
