&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t run data pipelines yourself — you own the customer relationship, shape requirements into delivery outcomes, and partner closely with the teams who execute them. The ideal candidate is organized, execution-focused, and thrives on managing complexity. Precision across tracking, documentation, and customer follow-through is what builds trust and wins repeat work.&lt;/p&gt;
