&lt;p&gt;As a Field Engineer on our federal AI projects, you&#39;ll work directly with our largest public sector customers to make sure their experience with Scale&#39;s technology is smooth and successful. You&#39;ll help these customers build production-grade data pipelines, working closely with our Product, Engineering, and Operations teams. This means learning each customer&#39;s use cases in depth and building the tools and documentation they need to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits at the intersection of customer delivery, product, and engineering. The ideal candidate is a generalist software engineer who enjoys working with clients, takes ambiguous problems and turns them into practical solutions, and collaborates closely with Product and Engineering along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An active TS/SCI clearance is required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
