&lt;li&gt;Hands-on technical experience working with clients in a pre- or post-sales capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development experience with Python, JavaScript, or other modern languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong engineering background, ideally in computer science, mathematics, or another quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
