&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Head of Solutions Engineering to lead and grow our technical pre-sales function across the EMEA region. You’ll define how we bring our AI services to customers - from the first discovery conversation to pilot, deployment, and production success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the regional leader, you’ll hire, mentor, and scale a team of world-class Solutions Engineers &amp;amp; Solution Architects who partner closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering. You’ll set the standard for how we demonstrate technical value, architect customer solutions, and operationalize go-to-market excellence across diverse markets in EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic, hands-on leadership role - part player-coach, part builder, and part visionary. You’ll balance tactical deal support with the long-term mission of building a scalable, high-impact GTM organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and regional leadership to drive technical strategy, qualification, and execution for complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and operationalize repeatable pre-sales processes, tools, and playbooks to accelerate customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a world-class Solutions Engineering organization across EMEA — recruiting, mentoring, and enabling a distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical discovery, demo, and proof-of-concept lifecycle, ensuring pilots translate into production wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Scale’s platform and technology capabilities to executives, technical stakeholders, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product and Engineering teams to bring customer insights back into roadmap discussions and feature design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop regional enablement programs to ensure consistent technical excellence across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive key metrics: pilot-to-production conversion, team utilization, revenue influence, and customer adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of curiosity, innovation, and accountability, fostering deep AI understanding and go-to-market discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a thought leader in the region — representing Scale at industry events, executive briefings, and ecosystem forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Solutions Engineering, Sales Engineering, or Technical Consulting, with 4+ years in a leadership capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and scaling technical pre-sales or customer engineering teams across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in cloud architecture, enterprise infrastructure, and API-driven products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on technical ability — comfortable both building prototypes and guiding your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI/ML technologies, data platforms, and modern model deployment practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated executive presence and credibility with both technical and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional collaboration skills, aligning Sales, Product, and Services toward shared outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial and strategic mindset — able to connect technical work to business value and regional go-to-market goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating diverse, fast-evolving markets and driving impact in ambiguous, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel frequently across EMEA to support customers and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
