&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in AI infrastructure, ML operations, or applied data science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across enterprise, government, and startup ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of regional AI, data, and privacy regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience launching new markets or scaling teams during rapid growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of developing enablement content, demos, and GTM playbooks for technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
