&lt;p&gt;Scale AI is hiring a Mission Product Specialist to shape the product strategy behind Thunderforge&#39;s ModSim and planning-tool integrations across our strategic partners. This role sits at the intersection of joint military planning and product judgment — you&#39;ll define how the tool chain should evolve for planners at PACOM, EUCOM, NORTHCOM, and other commands, and stay close enough to the technical build to keep that strategy grounded in reality.&lt;/p&gt;
