&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generative AI Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience working with large language models (LLMs) and/or vision-language models (VLMs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile &amp;amp; Waterfall:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep familiarity with both Agile/Scrum and Waterfall methodologies, and the ability to hybridize them effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
