&lt;p&gt;You’ll split your time between &lt;strong&gt;technical planning and execution (50%)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;people management and team development (50%)&lt;/strong&gt;, leading a team of 6-8 engineers. You’ll work cross-functionally with product, security, and customer-facing teams to ensure our engineering efforts meet complex federal compliance, security, and performance needs.&lt;/p&gt;
