&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active TS/SCI clearance (Full Scope Polygraph is a nice to have)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience succeeding in stakeholder management or customer-facing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical background (education or professional experience with CS, Economics, Statistics, Engineering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of ML operations process&lt;/li&gt;
