&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in robotics, physical AI, or hardware operations environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish language proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to certification or credentialing program design.&lt;/li&gt;
