&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are looking for a talented and experienced University Recruiter, Contractor based in San Francisco to join our team and participate in the hiring process from beginning to end. You’ll be working directly with our hiring partners, recruiters and candidates to create a personal and positive recruiting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Scale’s University Recruiting strategy: assist with the hiring process for our Internship and New Grad programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full-cycle recruiting strategy and process including, but not limited to, sourcing, screening, interview process, closing and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand what makes a great profile for our University roles and drive strategic sourcing and candidate engagement strategies to build strong and diverse pools of candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with students across partnered universities and develop positive relationships with faculty, staff, and student organizations as part of a well-researched recruiting strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
